[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[29d"]
[0.000, "o", "Your pager tickles you awake.\r\u001b[30d[MORE]\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.526, "o", "\u001b[H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m                                                                                               Home \u001b[2;1H                                                                                     Sunday 9:05 pm \u001b[9;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mYour pager tickles you awake.\r\u001b[11dUpstairs in the house of your childhood, in your room, and it must be time for school because -- no,\u001b[12;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "it's the weekend, you remember, but your alarm is going off anyway. You should have been awake\r\u001b[13dalready. You're going to miss the bus. Your mother climbs in the window. You're dreaming.\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "You're a grown-up: It opens to you again, a sluggish window summoned by a mouse click. Waking up now\u001b[16;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "in your own apartment, your new apartment. Your pager is buzzing and vibrating both, serious. It is\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "in fact the weekend, but you're not in elementary school. No one is crawling in through the window.\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "You're a system administrator for nWare. Waking up urgently, here in nTopia.\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mHome\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mThe constellations on the ceiling are as you left them: Pisces, Cetus, Aquarius, and the ones\r\u001b[25dwithout celestial referent, left by some crazed astronomer in residence here before you. What could\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "you call them? The Cradle, The Way, The Burning Book...\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "They're still glowing, too. Must not have napped for long.\r\u001b[29d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[30d>\u001b[K"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
