[0.000, "o", "\u001b[11M\u001b[2;9H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m|   out\u001b[96G"]
[0.000, "o", "7\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mYou switch the light on.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "The pager buzzes and jars you, its motor driven to disrupt and demand attention. This is no Harry\r\u001b[23dPotter broomstick.\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mHome\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mAlthough almost unfurnished, since you've been here only a few days and haven't had time to settle\r\u001b[27din, the place is more \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mFight Club\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[23m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m than \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mShade:\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[23m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m young, urbane, professional. It's yours, though. It's\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "your residential canister. And it looks like we also have your nLap 500 and a heap of clothes.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.405, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40ml\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
