[0.090, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mk\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[7M\u001b[2;96H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m9\r\u001b[25d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mHome\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mIt's your residential canister. And it looks like we also have your nLap 500 and a heap of clothes.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "The pager vibrates like it's repeatedly tapping you to get your attention, and it buzzes gratingly.\r\u001b[30d>"]
