[0.000, "o", "\u001b[12M\u001b[2;95H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m11\r\u001b[19d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mCell phones are ubiquitous in nTopia, and your pager is a sort of funky, retro sheriff's badge among\u001b[20;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "them. Press the gray button there, and any voice messages you have will play; hold the button to\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "erase them. The vibration and buzzing mean that an urgent message, or one the sender thought was\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "urgent, has arrived and has not yet been played.\r\u001b[24dYour nRich cybercash chip is installed in your pager, along with your nPediment identifier tag for\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "keyless entry, the same one that most of your co-workers have installed in their phones, wallets, or\u001b[26;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "upper arms.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "The buzzing of the pager continues. You are tooth to the dental drill of the device.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
